' A production's tool put into a room refreshes the place's production at
' once (`preset classic ai none seed 3 start 30 party give
' item_rat_trap,item_rat_trap`, as `v12_trap_select`): v1.2's
' `OnLeftClickItemInventory` calls `RefreshFoodProductionSelection` when the
' item has a production (`InventoryScene.cs:638`), and the automatic choice
' takes the trap's rats if they make more. The save's camp line says which,
' before any day has passed.
press escape             ' Back closes the manual v1.2 opens on a new game's first world map (MapScene.cs:687-691)
mapclick 110,122         ' into Paradise Camp
wait 60
join                     ' camped here: the place is ours
wait 10
mapclick 177,150         ' the tent
wait 200
uiclick 168,248          ' a rat trap put down
wait 5
esc
wait 10
save
quit
